  "content": "[Intro]\n[Dm7]  [Am]\n[Gm]  [Abm]\n[Dm7]  [Am]\n[Gm]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Dm7]Baby hair\n[C]with a woman's eyes\n[Bbmaj7]I can feel you watching\n[Asus4]in the night [A]\n[Dm7]All alone with me and\n[C]we're waiting for the\n[Bbmaj7]sunlight\n[Asus4]  [A]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Bbmaj7]When I feel [C]cold,\n[Dbdim]you warm [Dm7]me And when I\n[Bbmaj7]feel I can't [C]go on, you come and\n[Eb7]hold [Dm7]me It's\n[Gm7]you and me forever\nSara\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dm7]smile [Am]\n[Gm][Abm]Won't you\n[Dm7]smile a while for me, [Am]Sara\n[Gm]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dm7]If you feel like leaving,\n[C]you know you can go\n[Bbmaj7]But why don't you stay until tomorrow?\n[Asus4]  [A]\n[Dm7]If you want to be free,\n[C]you know,\n[Bbmaj7]all you got to do is\n[Asus4]say so [A]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Bbmaj7]And when you feel [C]cold,\n[Dbdim]I'll warm [Dm7]you And when you\n[Bbmaj7]feel you can't go [C]on, I'll come and\n[Eb7]hold [Dm7]you It's\n[Gm7]you and me forever\nSara\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dm7]smile [Am]\n[Gm][Abm]Won't you\n[Dm7]smile a while for me, [Am]Sara\n[Gm]Sara\n[Dm7]smile [Am]\n[Gm][Abm]Won't you\n[Dm7]smile a while for me, [Am]Sara\n[Gm]\n\n[Bridge]\n[Gm]  [C]\n[F]  [Bb]  [Bbdim/Db]\n\n[Outro (Fade Out)]\n[Dm7]Smile [Am]\n[Gm][Abm]Won't you\n[Dm7]smile a while for me, [Am]Sara\n[Gm]Oh\n[Dm7]smile a while, [Am]won't you\n[Gm]laugh Sara [Abm]\n[Dm7][Am]Make me\n[Gm]feel like a man not keeping me crazy\n[Dm7]Smile a while [Am]\n[Gm]  [Abm]",
